したいです...✨\n______\n\n至らない点や不足している情報があるかと思います。\n基本的に全て冬さまにおまかせいたします。\n何卒よろしくお願い申し上げます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1oO682s4U7IqCFeAy1br3gkTS0--pgCCz?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Winter/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2489059, "client_id": 1898187, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c0c20c02/uploads/origins/ee51b682-e811-4217-838d-5ac53551ceb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8f01bf6f93436df61b120a88ea0f63d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c0c20c02/uploads/origins/ee51b682-e811-4217-838d-5ac53551ceb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8f01bf6f93436df61b120a88ea0f63d, https://si.imgix.net/c0c20c02/uploads/origins/ee51b682-e811-4217-838d-5ac53551ceb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad080d87f12f5e2ced50ed20b0b1d436 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c0c20c02/uploads/origins/ee51b682-e811-4217-838d-5ac53551ceb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=700973d580ef2a661789231d86eb70fe 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c0c20c02/uploads/origins/ee51b682-e811-4217-838d-5ac53551ceb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e28a3e180ebd2d98229f58ad0d718f17", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c0c20c02/uploads/origins/ee51b682-e811-4217-838d-5ac53551ceb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e28a3e180ebd2d98229f58ad0d718f17, https://si.imgix.net/c0c20c02/uploads/origins/ee51b682-e811-4217-838d-5ac53551ceb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=347c7b1464396700c6780203226b4554 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c0c20c02/uploads/origins/ee51b682-e811-4217-838d-5ac53551ceb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7a589dad8591869751f08da47f1292e7 3x"}, "body": "안녕하세요, 언제나 그림 잘 보고있습니다.\n\nSkeb 요청으로 찾아뵙습니다.\n\n제 자캐가 야외 벤치에 앉아, 노을 지는 풍경을 바라보며[풍경을 강조하기 위에 캐릭터의 모습이 뒤에서 보이는 것은 원치 않습니다.]차(또는 커피)한잔 마시는 모습이 보고싶습니다.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NIyW5KFpDwpa3Es2sJBhUaGStgCQ40i_?usp=sharing\n\n자캐 캐릭터 시트는 위와 같으며,\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/101334312\n\n벤치에 앉아 차를 마신다는 느낌은 위쪽 그림을 참고해주시면 될것 같습니다.\n\n계절은 가을즈음으로 설정해주시고, 단풍잎(빨간색이 좋을것 같습니다.)이 조금 휘날려도 괜찮을 것 같습니다.\n\n캐릭터의 표정은 위와 비슷하되 풍경을 바라본다는것이 강조되는 쪽으로 해주시고, 복장도 위와 비슷하되 좀 더 캐릭터와 어울리게 어레인지 해주시면 감사하겠습니다.\n\n해상도는 1280 x 1440 기준 비율로 희망합니다. (예 : 3520 x 3960 등)", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Winter/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2489059, "client_id": 1327171, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/778cafa7/uploads/origins/1adfaa68-6910-42f2-8c4e-99408d308b8a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c5b96fb05ad72ed1aa25732f0b335a8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/778cafa7/uploads/origins/1adfaa68-6910-42f2-8c4e-99408d308b8a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c5b96fb05ad72ed1aa25732f0b335a8, https://si.imgix.net/778cafa7/uploads/origins/1adfaa68-6910-42f2-8c4e-99408d308b8a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9d34d2226dbfc96152bc1d0f8a30f95 2x, https://si.imgix.net/778cafa7/uploads/origins/1adfaa68-6910-42f2-8c4e-99408d308b8a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ded83ef7a12b6cb12f8bf9aa8ced704 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/778cafa7/uploads/origins/1a